' A key held through a load (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30`).
' Saved at 64,160 in Paradise Camp; the right arrow held 960 ms (60 frames);
' five frames in, the save is loaded (back to 64,160); the arrow is still
' down and he walks on from there: the last save has him at 174,160.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
save                     ' 64,160
holdkey right 960
wait 5
load                     ' back to 64,160, the key still down
wait 70
save                     ' 174,160
quit
